OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer hurt after
OL,4,ALiverpool-Man City game
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer was injured, and 10
OL,7,Fpeople arrested - including five on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of tragedy chanting - after
OL,9,Ftrouble flared when Liverpool played
OL,10,FManchester City in a fevered atmosphere
OL,11,Fat Anfield over the weekend.
OL,13,FMerseyside Police said one man was
OL,14,Farrested on suspicion of two offences
OL,15,Fof assault against a constable,
OL,16,Ffollowing Sunday's game in Liverpool,
OL,17,Fwhich City won 3-0.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
