OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1791807956
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer hurt after
OL,4,ALiverpool-Man City game
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerseyside Police's Leanne Hobin called
OL,7,Fthe behaviour - which left a PC with a
OL,8,Fserious facial injury -
OL,9,F"disappointing", and stressed tragedy
OL,10,Fchanting "had no place in football".
OL,12,FSunday's match was the first game for
OL,13,FCity since the club was found guilty of
OL,14,F114 charges over the breaching of
OL,15,FPremier League financial rules.
